## uc--new

Create a new use-case folder under `data/<uc>/`.

- ask/derive `<uc>` id (folder name, e.g. `uc09`) + label + description
- scaffold: `use-case.json`, empty `structure.json`, `data-sources/`, `runs/`
- `use-case.json` = `{ label, description }` (id = folder name)
- pick initial structure type: `questions` or `spreadsheet` (empty either way)
- run `bun run check` after to verify integrity

---

## uc--edit-structure

Edit `data/<uc>/structure.json` — add/remove/edit questions or spreadsheet cells.

- detect type (`questions` vs `spreadsheet`) before editing
- questions: append/modify `{ id, uc, type, depth, text, groundTruth, trap?, pair? }`
- enforce id format + uniqueness within uc
- keep `uc` field matching folder name
- warn if edits invalidate existing run answers (id renames, deletions)
- `bun run check` after

---

## uc-run--new

Create new versioned run `data/<uc>/runs/<vN>/`.

- auto-pick next `v<N>` from existing runs
- scaffold `run.json` (`{ id, date, notes? }`) — date = today
- snapshot ground truth into run.json per data model
- create empty per-competitor folders from `data/competitors.json`? or on-demand?
- no answers/verdicts files yet — those land via the register skill

---

## uc-run--grade-competitor-answers

Produce `answers.verdicts.json` for one competitor in a run.

- inputs: `<uc>`, `<run>`, `<competitorId>`
- read structure (ground truth) + competitor `answers.json`
- per question: assign `verdict` ∈ {correct, partial, wrong, retrieval-fail, not-run} + optional `verdictReason`
- write `data/<uc>/runs/<run>/<cid>/answers.verdicts.json`
- skip questions already graded? or always overwrite?
- `bun run check` after

---

## uc-run--register-competitor-answers

Ingest raw competitor output into `answers.json` for a run.

- inputs: `<uc>`, `<run>`, `<competitorId>`, raw output (paste / file)
- map raw output → `{ questionId, answerText }[]` against current structure
- write `data/<uc>/runs/<run>/<cid>/answers.json`
- also drop/update `instructions.md` for what the competitor was told?
- flag unmatched questions / extra answers
- `bun run check` after

